    "answer_key": "(a) g(x) = h(x) ⟹ x = x² ⟹ x² − x = 0 ⟹ x(x−1) = 0 ⟹ x₁ = 0, x₂ = 1. (b) Auf [0,1] gilt g(x) ≥ h(x) (da x ≥ x² für x ∈ [0,1]). A = ∫₀¹ (x − x²) dx = [x²/2 − x³/3]₀¹ = 1/2 − 1/3 = 3/6 − 2/6 = 1/6.",
